    "detailed_description": "Face off against hell forces in shooter &quot;Grimwalker&quot;. Engage in thrilling combat with a variety of weapons and use your demon form to become even more powerful. Explore a world filled with secrets while managing your resources to survive.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369630/extras/ea508842371c88a6046db2a8377e0da9.poster.avif?t=1751210174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369630/extras/ea508842371c88a6046db2a8377e0da9.webm?t=1751210174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369630/extras/ea508842371c88a6046db2a8377e0da9.mp4?t=1751210174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Use a diverse arsenal of weapons, from classic rifles and pistols to melee weapons. Proper selection of equipment is the key to victory in the fight against hordes of demonic creatures.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369630/extras/5e5cd5e710a36679f3075c1bca411784.poster.avif?t=1751210174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369630/extras/5e5cd5e710a36679f3075c1bca411784.webm?t=1751210174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369630/extras/5e5cd5e710a36679f3075c1bca411784.mp4?t=1751210174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It's not just a shooter, but also a world full of mysteries and puzzles that can be explored. Manage your equipment and search for resources that give you a chance to survive.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369630/extras/cf425c3afc949f9a2cb6fce3edf4c62b.poster.avif?t=1751210174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369630/extras/cf425c3afc949f9a2cb6fce3edf4c62b.webm?t=1751210174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369630/extras/cf425c3afc949f9a2cb6fce3edf4c62b.mp4?t=1751210174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Transform into your demonic form and wreak havoc among your enemies. Everyone has their limits... as a demon, you can ignore them.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369630/extras/4109ada6b4b8cbcc7a1358cbc28968ad.poster.avif?t=1751210174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369630/extras/4109ada6b4b8cbcc7a1358cbc28968ad.webm?t=1751210174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369630/extras/4109ada6b4b8cbcc7a1358cbc28968ad.mp4?t=1751210174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Stand up to fight against hordes of demonic creatures that have taken over the forgotten village and unravel the mystery of the demons.",
